name: kompressor
version: "@VERSION@"
origin: sysutils/kompressor
comment: "OptScale Kompressor: deterministic prompt compression for agent traffic"
maintainer: "Hystax"
www: "https://github.com/hystax/optscale-kompressor"
prefix: /usr/local
abi: "@ABI@"
arch: "@ABI@"
licenselogic: single
licenses: [MIT]
categories: [sysutils]
desc: <<EOD
OptScale Kompressor: deterministic prompt compression for agent traffic.
Rewrites tool results, logs and API responses in flight into a shorter view
that says what it removed, and keeps every removed fragment behind a handle
the model can ask for by name. Runs as a library, a CLI, an HTTP API, an MCP
server or a reverse proxy.

To run the proxy as a service:
  sysrc kompressor_enable=YES
  service kompressor start
EOD
